x}^{2} & =8 \\\\ 2{x}^{2} & =8 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =4 \\\\ x & =\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in ascending order, the $x$-coordinates of the points of intersection are\n$x=-2$ and $x=2.$" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283901 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283902 13194139534352 true] [17592186283901 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534352 true] [17592186283901 1041 "field-1" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283901 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283902 13194139534352 true] [17592186283901 1110 #uuid "6d4c7cc2-2d02-5c8a-a77e-2125403b00b7" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283902 1034 "-2" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283902 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283902 1111 #uuid "3cdf9991-54c0-5907-b4c4-386c77f27b9c" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283903 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283904 13194139534352 true] [17592186283903 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534352 true] [17592186283903 1041 "field-2" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283903 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283904 13194139534352 true] [17592186283903 1110 #uuid "84db0e4a-cac2-5576-81dd-9da53bef1cd8" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283904 1034 "2" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283904 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283904 1111 #uuid "cc988383-1e89-5565-9753-3d079cedb0fb" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283906 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283909 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1089 "q-278367" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1100 "The $y$-intercept of the hyperbola $\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{16}-(y-2)^{2}=1$ is$\\,(${{field-1}},\n{{field-2}}$).$" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1113 #uuid "7eb5a312-9e17-5376-b02f-6c5d94a3e099" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283905 1145 "To find the $y$-intercepts of the hyperbola, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{16}-(y-2)^{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(0-4)^{2}}{16}-(y-2)^{2} & =1 \\\\ 1-(y-2)^{2} & =1 \\\\ -(y-2)^{2} & =0 \\\\ (y-2)^{2} & =0 \\\\ y-2 & =0 \\\\ y & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $y$-intercept is $(0,2).$" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283906 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283907 13194139534352 true] [17592186283906 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283908 13194139534352 true] [17592186283906 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534352 true] [17592186283906 1041 "field-1" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283906 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283908 13194139534352 true] [17592186283906 1110 #uuid "65adb29f-0546-5cc4-a0cb-ded906e2c674" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283907 1034 "4" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283907 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283907 1111 #uuid "327d555d-be85-5e47-a482-c1ccaab50031" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283908 1034 "0" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283908 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283908 1111 #uuid "f671af5b-c88c-5184-9667-77abe37f494b" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283909 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283910 13194139534352 true] [17592186283909 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534352 true] [17592186283909 1041 "field-2" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283909 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283910 13194139534352 true] [17592186283909 1110 #uuid "c2a6977f-cfb2-5fe7-a638-47ef91018e92" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283910 1034 "2" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283910 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283910 1111 #uuid "b562017c-fc0e-5a21-b378-774a1f9b6801" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283912 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283914 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283916 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283918 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1089 "q-278373" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1100 "From **top to bottom**, the points where the hyperbola $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1$ intersects the line $x=-5$ are\n\n$($\n{{field-1}}, \n{{field-2}} $)\\,$\nand\n$\\,($\n{{field-3}}, \n{{field-4}} $).$" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1113 #uuid "0ae6351e-00df-5331-8db9-fd4755bafd57" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283911 1145 "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $x=-5,$ we substitute $x=-5$ into the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(-5)^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{25}{16}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ -\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1-\\frac{25}{16} \\\\ -\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =-\\frac{9}{16} \\\\ {y}^{2} & =\\frac{9}{4} \\\\ y & =\\pm \\frac{3}{2} \\\\ y & =\\pm 1.5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, from top to bottom, the hyperbola intersects the vertical line $x=-5$  at the points $(-5,1.5)$ and $(-5,-1.5).$" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283913 13194139534352 true] [17592186283912 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534352 true] [17592186283912 1041 "field-1" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283912 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283913 13194139534352 true] [17592186283912 1110 #uuid "5f2f91c4-160d-59fc-bfbb-58a1b85c6b30" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283913 1034 "-5" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283913 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283913 1111 #uuid "489c0159-c147-5c45-b6ba-1526e857a640" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283914 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283915 13194139534352 true] [17592186283914 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534352 true] [17592186283914 1041 "field-2" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283914 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283915 13194139534352 true] [17592186283914 1110 #uuid "9844d9c3-fe87-50ae-a3f3-bcc590a114eb" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283915 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139534352 true] [17592186283915 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534352 true] [17592186283915 1111 #uuid "c6c96545-d7a5-52c1-9192-98a70711e282" 131